WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,040
Since he has resigned, he will die without proof.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,520
The contract is not authenticated, right?

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,160
Then I just want to ask you one thing

4
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,360
The 45 million villa I bought

5
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,200
Sales commission on company accounts

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,720
Whose account is this sent to?

7
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,320
This is an internal company secret

8
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,680
No comment, Zhao Qian took out her phone

9
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,080
Dial 110 directly to call the police

10
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,520
Just say that someone takes advantage of their position

11
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,440
Suspected of job embezzlement and huge amount of explosives

12
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:27,700
Let the Jingzhen system directly check the financial statements of Tianlan dealers. Boss, please don’t call the police.

13
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:31,080
I can submit a survey

14
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,720
After the contract leaked the commission clause

15
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,240
I used my approval authority to transfer the commission

16
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,520
Transferred to own account

17
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,800
I am willing to return the money

18
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,680
Also accepted for investigation by the company and relevant departments

19
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,160
He told everything

20
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,520
A refund will not absolve you of your sins

21
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,120
Transfer contracts and approval records

22
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:50,760
will be handed over to the company and relevant departments
